Combat Sphere Specialization - Alchemy	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat.SpheresFeat.SpheresFeatCombatSphereSpecialization	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Combat Talent,Alchemy Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_BAB_ALCHEMY|min(max(0,TL-BAB),1+floor((TL-1)/4))	DESC:Your knowledge of one particular combat sphere is without peer. Prerequisite: 1 or more combat spheres. Benefit: Select one combat sphere you possess, you treat your base attack bonus as 1 higher for the purposes of its effects, but not for attacks made with talents from that sphere. At 5th level and every 4 levels afterwards, the chosen sphere’s base attack bonus is treated as an additional 1 higher, although the sphere’s effective base attack bonus cannot be higher than your character level. Special: You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different sphere. Selected sphere: Alchemy.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc17
Combat Sphere Specialization - Athletics	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat.SpheresFeat.SpheresFeatCombatSphereSpecialization	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Combat Talent,Athletics Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_BAB_ATHLETICS|min(max(0,TL-BAB),1+floor((TL-1)/4))	DESC:Your knowledge of one particular combat sphere is without peer. Prerequisite: 1 or more combat spheres. Benefit: Select one combat sphere you possess, you treat your base attack bonus as 1 higher for the purposes of its effects, but not for attacks made with talents from that sphere. At 5th level and every 4 levels afterwards, the chosen sphere’s base attack bonus is treated as an additional 1 higher, although the sphere’s effective base attack bonus cannot be higher than your character level. Special: You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different sphere. Selected sphere: Athletics.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc17
Combat Sphere Specialization - Barrage	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat.SpheresFeat.SpheresFeatCombatSphereSpecialization	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Combat Talent,Barrage Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_BAB_BARRAGE|min(max(0,TL-BAB),1+floor((TL-1)/4))	DESC:Your knowledge of one particular combat sphere is without peer. Prerequisite: 1 or more combat spheres. Benefit: Select one combat sphere you possess, you treat your base attack bonus as 1 higher for the purposes of its effects, but not for attacks made with talents from that sphere. At 5th level and every 4 levels afterwards, the chosen sphere’s base attack bonus is treated as an additional 1 higher, although the sphere’s effective base attack bonus cannot be higher than your character level. Special: You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different sphere. Selected sphere: Barrage.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc17
Combat Sphere Specialization - Barroom	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat.SpheresFeat.SpheresFeatCombatSphereSpecialization	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Spheres Combat Talent,Barroom Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_BAB_BARROOM|min(max(0,TL-BAB),1+floor((TL-1)/4))	DESC:Your knowledge of one particular combat sphere is without peer. Prerequisite: 1 or more combat spheres. Benefit: Select one combat sphere you possess, you treat your base attack bonus as 1 higher for the purposes of its effects, but not for attacks made with talents from that sphere. At 5th level and every 4 levels afterwards, the chosen sphere’s base attack bonus is treated as an additional 1 higher, although the sphere’s effective base attack bonus cannot be higher than your character level. Special: You may select this feat multiple times, each time selecting a different sphere. Selected sphere: Barroom.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc17
